    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_YvxBVsWaMgsofKpx",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Got Questions?  </h3><h3>We Have Answers.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_L5r0TMLMdCIa6ZGi",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>What is Lio?</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_d59svpw6nkQhRXFd",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Lio</strong> is a <strong>natural, nicotine-free alternative</strong> to smoking and vaping. It mimics the hand-to-mouth habit while delivering <strong>flavored, chemical-free air</strong>, helping you reduce cravings and quit harmful habits for good.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Lsh73Nq75kau1bje",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Does Lio really work?</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_kKPPoE3QD2jrKZlP",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Yes, <strong>Lio has helped thousands of people</strong> reduce or completely quit smoking and vaping by mimicking the hand-to-mouth habit and providing a satisfying, nicotine-free sensory experience. It’s designed to <strong>ease cravings without harmful chemicals, smoke, or vapor.</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_DzlcGEpZE6bbpDQP",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How does Lio work?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_IBMvNNRNABrYBYff",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Lio works by <strong>replacing the hand-to-mouth fixation</strong> with naturally infused air, offering calming, refreshing flavors <strong>without nicotine, smoke, or chemicals.</strong> This action helps reduce the psychological need for smoking or vaping while keeping you engaged with familiar habits.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_WyxTClFbSlpvqMFR",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Can I use Lio anywhere?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_MmD2s3wF6rubDTt3",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Yes! <strong>Lio produces no smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals</strong>, so it can be used in most places where smoking or vaping are not allowed. Its <strong>discreet and clean</strong> design makes it a convenient, portable option to carry and use anywhere, whether you’re at home, work, or on the go.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_IgI6rjE5oJKvXzOE",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Does Lio produce smoke or vapor?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_SZ415r3TpCe9KE3m",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>No, <strong>Lio does not produce any smoke or vapor.</strong> It offers a nicotine-free, chemical-free inhalation experience that focuses on delivering refreshing, natural flavors, without the harmful byproducts of smoking or vaping.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_BJsiko6rnDfKfqBD",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Does Lio feel like my bad habit?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_klJhwlRTCYP5StJJ",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>While <strong>Lio doesn’t produce smoke or vapor</strong>, it offers a similar sensation by mimicking the hand-to-mouth action and providing a refreshing throat hit from its natural flavours. Users report that it’s an <strong>effective tool for replacing the physical habit</strong> of smoking or vaping.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_cXMtA09P1Ad76Tki",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>What if my order is delayed?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_AcqjmsctG6ViTJWm",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>If your Lio order is delayed or doesn’t arrive, please contact our <strong>customer support team</strong> at support@breathelio.com We’ll ensure your order is tracked and delivered, or send a replacement if necessary.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_OAET4ii0s7TmMQcd",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Can Lio help with intense cravings?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_pjyL4UJR2rkIUFsY",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Yes, many users report that <strong>Lio helps significantly reduce their cravings</strong> by providing a satisfying hand-to-mouth habit and refreshing flavors, helping to replace the need for nicotine, especially during stressful moments.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_ftFU6cDvhVQMahTO",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How long do the Lio Cores last?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_AEaa8tPFCuQ8KE77",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Each <strong>Lio Core lasts 2-4 days,</strong> depending on your usage. Heavy users may need to replace the cores more frequently, but they are designed to provide lasting flavor and a satisfying experience.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_3lzut1ijUgGqUTjt",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How soon can I expect to notice results after switching to Lio?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_DnWbJkPvz24BrXtH",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Many users report <strong>noticing a reduction in nicotine cravings within the first few days</strong> of using Lio. For some, it helps immediately, while others experience a more gradual transition away from smoking or vaping.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_hjAdkdTy3Ztrjwmj",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Will Lio help reduce my anxiety?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_UQVu5C0r4oehDuow",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Yes, many users report that the act of using Lio—similar to smoking or vaping—helps <strong>reduce stress and anxiety</strong> by providing a <strong>calming, nicotine-free experience.</strong> The satisfying hand-to-mouth action and natural flavors contribute to a sense of relaxation.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_EpYk2F4wxRipMwrq",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How much does Lio cost?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_yAGx9obboBhvwbSq",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Lio is <strong>90% cheaper</strong> than traditional smoking or vaping. The long-lasting cores mean you won’t need to buy expensive nicotine cartridges or tobacco products, making Lio an <strong>affordable solution for quitting.</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_KsY86zhy4tux35t4",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Is Lio safe to use?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_DUHlUWM7i26oFBOI",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Lio is made with <strong>100% natural ingredients</strong> and is completely free from <strong>nicotine, smoke, and harmful chemicals,</strong> making it a <strong>safe and healthier alternative</strong> for people trying to quit smoking or vaping.</h3>"
    },
